# Settings for `stick`. Copy this file to .env (same folder) and uncomment what you use.
# .env is not committed. stick reads it from the folder you run it in; a variable already set in
# your shell wins over this file. Every line below shows the default, or an example.

# --- Cloud models: API keys ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Avoid putting a real API key in this file. It is plain text: any program running as you can
# read it, and it is easy to leak through a backup or a mistaken commit. Better:
#   - Linux: a local proxy that holds the key, so no tool ever sees it. One option is keyveil
#     (https://github.com/Jitter00/keyveil; young project, read its "Threat model" first). The
#     key stays encrypted on disk and keyveil adds it to each request, so stick only needs:
#       STICK_ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8787/anthropic
#       ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=proxy-handles-auth      (a placeholder, not a key)
#   - Any system: keep the key in a password manager and export it for the session only, e.g.
#       export ANTHROPIC_API_KEY="$(pass show anthropic/api-key)"
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
# STICK_API_KEY=                 # for --model openai-compat/<model>, if that server wants a key

# --- Server addresses ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# One per provider: STICK_<PROVIDER>_BASE_URL. --base-url on the command line wins over these.
# STICK_OLLAMA_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:11434/v1
# STICK_LMSTUDIO_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:1234/v1
# STICK_VLLM_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1
# STICK_LLAMACPP_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8080/v1
# STICK_STRATA_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8080/v1
# STICK_OPENAI_COMPAT_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:9000/v1
# STICK_OPENAI_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1
# STICK_OPENROUTER_BASE_URL=https://openrouter.ai/api/v1
# STICK_ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL=https://api.anthropic.com
# OLLAMA_HOST=127.0.0.1:11434    # the Ollama CLI's own setting; stick follows it too

# --- Optional -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# STICK_MODEL_TIMEOUT_S=600      # seconds to wait for one reply from a model
# STICK_HOME=                    # folder with your own topologies/, sections/, services/ ...
